**Contract Excerpt: Hotel and Restaurant Services Agreement**

This Agreement, effective as of January 1, 2024, between Grand Vista Hotels, Inc. ("GVH"), located at 123 Ocean Drive, Miami Beach, FL, and Culinary Creations LLC ("CC"), located at 456 Gourmet Way, Miami, FL, stipulates that CC shall provide exclusive catering services to all events hosted at GVH, including but not limited to weddings and corporate retreats, for the duration of this contract. All reservations for guest accommodations made through the GVH online booking system shall require a minimum of 30 days' notice for events exceeding 50 attendees, with CC obligated to deliver finalized menu selections no later than 14 days prior to the event date. In consideration of services rendered, GVH agrees to compensate CC at a rate of $75 per guest, with an estimated participation of 150 guests for the inaugural event scheduled for March 15, 2024.